    "enUS": {
      "description": "<The gnoll pulls a bit of gold from his pocket and waves it at you.>\r\n\r\n{race}, I offer trade! There is more where this came from. Help me get revenge, and I will show you!",
      "summary": "Bring 20 Twilight Finger Bones to Fuzzle.",
      "title": "Biting the Hand",
